  "releaseNotes": "ValorantNet overhaul and some bug fixes\n**9.5.2**\n- For windows client, please mark your project as 'Targetting Windows' to improve your experience within RadiantConnect, as it overwrites system methods.\n- Now semi-supporting other OS's, please report issues.\n\n**9.5.1**\n- Fixed Driver Auth for certain regions\n- Added CLID Param to SSID Auth\n\n**9.5.0**\n**Fixed**\n- AuthenticateWithDriver not returning tokens properly (internal fix)\n- XMPP Controller is fixed overall\n\n+ Added\n- PlayerPresence event to XMPPControler\n- ValorantPresence event to XMPPController",
